# scripts/autoload/ — Singleton autoloads, registered in project.godot.
# Populated by P1-002:
#   game_state.gd   — single source of truth for all game values
#   save_system.gd  — JSON IO, schema migrations, cloud sync (ADR-0003)
#   data_loader.gd  — loads data/*.json (ADR-0004)
#   audio_manager.gd — bus routing, music layering
#   steam_api.gd    — GodotSteam wrapper, no-op if Steam absent
#   telemetry.gd    — opt-in event pipeline
